  "snp1.7:0.2": "<p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.175'>AN 5:175</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an10.176'>AN 10:165</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dhp129-145#dhp129'>Dhp 129–140</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dhp306-319#dhp306'>Dhp 306–319</a>;</p>",
