  "snp1.7:1.3": "",
  "snp1.7:1.4": "",
  "snp1.7:1.5": "The practice of not bypassing any donors on one’s almsround, one of the thirteen ascetic <i>(dhutaṅga)</i> practices. See <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag16.7'>Thag 16:7</a>.",
